guardian\u2019s and boost there power from crystals collected after you defeat the corrupted elementals.\n\nFight your way through 4 difficulty levels to master the Dragon Druid\u2019s abilities and become the ultimate protector of Gaia.", "short_description": "Sigils is a strategic action RPG with ability driven gameplay and roguelite elements. \n\nAbilities are powered by ancient sigils. Spells and action based skills are activated by selecting a sigil that defines the ability you use. Whether casting magic, firing your bow, or triggering movement based actions, each ability begins with a sigil choice. \n\nTest your mastery across four difficulty levels, each designed to challenge your understanding of the Dragon Druid\u2019s mechanics. "}]}, "developer_name": "Sigils", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sigils.studio/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sigils Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sigils.studio/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26463044706684306"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819239_1590138935649514_4934027115026592527_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_si